      "text": "We can substitute the given points into the equation $y = ax + b$ to find the values of $a$ and $b$:\n\nFor the point $(4,5)$:\n\\[5 = 4a + b \\quad \\text{(1)}\\]\n\nFor the point $(8,17)$:\n\\[17 = 8a + b \\quad \\text{(2)}\\]\n\nNow, we can subtract equation (1) from equation (2) to eliminate $b$ and solve for $a$:\n\\[17 - 5 = 8a + b - (4a + b)\\]\n\\[12 = 4a\\]\n\\[a = 3\\]\n\nNext, we substitute the value of $a$ back into equation (1) to solve for $b$:\n\\[5 = 4(3) + b\\]\n\\[5 = 12 + b\\]\n\\[b = 5 - 12\\]\n\\[b = -7\\]\n\nFinally, we find $a - b$:\n\\[a - b = 3 - (-7) = 3 + 7 = 10\\]\n\nTherefore, $a - b = \\boxed{10}$.",
